let __v_135 = pyrt::literals::decode("{\"$tuple\":[{\"$tuple\":[{\"$tuple\":[\"mattress\",\"mattresses\"]},\"The January sales and the Black Friday week are when mattresses are marked down, though most mattress prices are 'on sale' all year, so compare two or three on firmness rather than on the percentage off. Buy somewhere with a 60-night trial: ten minutes in a shop tells you little about how you will sleep.\"]},{\"$tuple\":[{\"$tuple\":[\"sofa\",\"sofas\",\"settee\",\"settees\",\"couch\",\"couches\",\"armchair\",\"armchairs\"]},\"Sofas are cheapest in the January sales and over bank holiday weekends, when the chains run 20 to 30 per cent off. A made-to-order sofa takes six to twelve weeks, so for Christmas you want to order by early November - and check the delivery date in writing rather than the one on the website.\"]},{\"$tuple\":[{\"$tuple\":[\"tv\",\"tvs\",\"television\",\"televisions\",\"telly\"]},\"Televisions are cheapest on Black Friday and in the January sales, and again in February to April, when the year's new models arrive and last year's drop a few hundred pounds for the same panel. If you do not need this year's model, spring is the quiet bargain.\"]},{\"$tuple\":[{\"$tuple\":[\"washing machine\",\"washing machines\",\"tumble dryer\",\"tumble dryers\",\"fridge\",\"fridge freezer\",\"freezer\",\"dishwasher\",\"oven\"]},\"White goods are cheapest on Black Friday and in the January sales, and the January price on last year's model usually beats the Black Friday one. Measure the gap and the doorway before you buy, and check the energy rating: over ten years the running cost matters more than the purchase price.\"]},{\"$tuple\":[{\"$tuple\":[\"laptop\",\"laptops\",\"computer\",\"computers\",\"tablet\",\"tablets\"]},\"Laptops and tablets are cheapest on Black Friday, in the January sales, and in the back-to-school weeks of late August when the makers push student models. A machine whose replacement has just launched drops the most, so check whether a newer model is out.\"]},{\"$tuple\":[{\"$tuple\":[\"phone\",\"phones\",\"mobile\",\"mobiles\",\"iphone\",\"smartphone\",\"smartphones\"]},\"The cheapest month for last year's phone is the one after the new model lands, which is usually late September to November, and Black Friday adds a further cut. Buying outright and keeping it four years is nearly always cheaper than the annual upgrade.\"]},{\"$tuple\":[{\"$tuple\":[\"car\",\"cars\",\"van\",\"vans\",\"motorbike\",\"motorbikes\"]},\"A car is cheapest at the end of a month or a quarter, when a dealer is chasing a sales target and will move on price, and in the quiet weeks of August and late December. New plates in March and September make the previous plate's stock cheaper, and a pre-registered car saves the most of all - just check you are the first registered keeper.\"]},{\"$tuple\":[{\"$tuple\":[\"coat\",\"coats\",\"winter coat\",\"winter coats\",\"jacket\",\"jackets\",\"winter boots\",\"wellingtons\",\"ski boots\",\"ski boot\",\"skiing\",\"ski\",\"snowboard\",\"snowboarding\"]},\"Winter coats and boots are cheapest in the January sales and at the end of the season in February, when the shops clear the rails for spring. Buy then for next winter, and buy the best you can afford: a waterproof shell at the higher price outlasts three cheap ones.\"]},{\"$tuple\":[{\"$tuple\":[\"summer clothes\",\"holiday clothes\",\"swimwear\",\"swimsuit\",\"sandals\",\"shorts\",\"sunglasses\"]},\"Summer clothes, swimwear and sandals are cheapest in August and early September, when the shops clear them out for knitwear, so late summer is the moment for next year's holiday. Sizes go first, so go early in the clearance rather than at the end of it.\"]},{\"$tuple\":[{\"$tuple\":[\"garden furniture\",\"barbecue\",\"barbecues\",\"bbq\",\"patio\",\"parasol\",\"sun lounger\"]},\"Garden furniture and barbecues are cheapest at the end of August and in September, when the season ends and the garden ranges go on clearance - but the choice is picked over by then. Buy late for price, or in March for choice.\"]},{\"$tuple\":[{\"$tuple\":[\"bike\",\"bikes\",\"bicycle\",\"bicycles\"]},\"Bikes are cheapest in September and October as the season ends, and again when next year's models arrive and the old ones are cleared. A last-year model with the same frame is the bargain worth having.\"]}]}")?;
